extract_frame(@S is generates @O, generates).
extract_frame(@S is increases @O, increases).
extract_frame(@S is reduces @O, reduces).
extract_frame(@S is influences @O, influences).
extract_frame(@S is affects @O, affects).
extract_frame(@S is determines @O, determines).
extract_frame(@S is defines @O, defines).
extract_frame(@S is describes @O, describes).
extract_frame(@S is replaces @O, replaces).
extract_frame(@S is covers @O, covers).
extract_frame(@S is supports @O, supports).
extract_frame(@S is surrounds @O, surrounds).
